OL,3,AExplosion on Russian ship at Libya port
OL,4,Acaused by suspected drone attack,
OL,5,Aofficials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FLater, on Sunday evening, the health
OL,8,Fministry said it had received injured
OL,9,Ffrom another ship that was targeted off
OL,10,Fthe coast of Benghazi, state media
OL,11,Freported. Their injuries were minor and
OL,12,Ftheir condition stable, the ministry
OL,13,Fsaid.
